<title>USA: Norfolk Southern starts tender for Conrail.</title>
<headline>Norfolk Southern starts tender for Conrail.</headline>
<dateline>NORFOLK, Va. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norfolk Southern Corp said Thursday it is starting its all-cash offer to take over Conrail Inc.</p>
<p>Norfolk is offering $100 cash per share for all outstanding common and series A convertible junior preferred shares of Conrail. The offer expires November 21 unless extended, Norfolk said.</p>
<p>On Wednesday Norfolk sued to block a proposed $8.4 billion merger between Conrail and CSX Corp, which bid $92.50 in cash and stock to acquire Conrail.</p>
<p>Earlier today Norfolk asked a U.S. District Court to give it an expedited hearing and access to documents related to the merger.</p>
